@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam shadowing false
actor Underwriter as U
boundary "Browser" as UI
control "Views + scoring" as App
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Joblib / ML pipeline" as ML
U -> UI : Run Risk Assessment
UI -> App : POST with session and CSRF
App -> DB : Authorised record + active model metadata
DB --> App : Applicant / ModelVersion
App -> App : Check role, sections and model gate
alt invalid access, input or model
  App --> UI : Denial or meaningful error; no invented score
else authorised and approved model available
  App -> ML : Load approved artifact
  App -> ML : predict_proba(feature row)
  ML --> App : Class probabilities
  App -> App : Score, confidence, rules, recommendations
  App -> DB : Save assessment + related outputs + audit
  DB --> App : Stored records
  App --> UI : Redirect to updated profile
end
note over App, ML
In-process inference; not an external Kaggle API.
Persistence messages grouped for readability,
not a claim of a single database transaction.
end note
@enduml
